Spring boot project
vprofile project
git clone-->mvn test-->mvn build-->codescanner-->repository-->kubernetescluster deploy

appimage: vprofile/vprofileapp:V1
	runs on port 8080
	
dbimage: vprofile/vprofiledb:V1
	in application.properties file
	host: vprodb
	password: vprodbpass

	this image had intially created accounts database already 
	mysql -u root -pvprodbpass

using the kubernetes for the deployment
	kind cluster is used
	apiVersion: kind.x-k8s.io/v1alpha4

